{"id": "EUVD-2026-85702", "enisaUuid": "a764f1b7-7ae5-34f6-ac26-98c50a5a429c", "description": "A flaw was found in the OpenShift console. An unauthenticated attacker can exploit a path traversal vulnerability by manipulating the `lng` and `ns` query parameters in the `/locales/resource.json` endpoint. This allows the attacker to read sensitive `*.json` files from the pod filesystem, including plugin manifests and configuration files. Furthermore, this flaw can enable path traversal against registered dynamic-plugin backends.", "datePublished": "2026-09-23T21:24:01", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-23T05:11:55", "baseScore": 7.5, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:N", "references": ["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:70587", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:70617", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:70647", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:71447", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:71450", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:71453", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:71454", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:73853", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:73869", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:77321", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:82813", "https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-75887", "https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2517889"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-75887", "GHSA-v74g-7mx6-787p"], "assigner": "redhat", "epss": 0.51, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0520e037-8598-39a8-ac00-f1938cb386eb", "product": {"name": "Red Hat OpenShift Container Platform 4.20", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 1790112153"}, {"id": "2a175f22-a94f-329d-9a64-95900e69ae47", "product": {"name": "Red Hat OpenShift Container Platform 4.13", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 1791299243"}, {"id": "8dedb220-04b4-3c73-8d2b-b06f9f7f468a", "product": {"name": "Red Hat OpenShift Container Pl